    category: "重大事件",
    title: "緯致科技遭偵測內部系統異常存取，員工個資可能曝險，公司立即進行資安隔離與鑑識",
    summary: "資訊技術服務公司緯致科技於10月8日偵測到內部系統發生異常存取行為。經調查確認，部分員工的個人資訊與公務聯繫資訊可能遭到曝險。緯致科技在發現異常後，立即採取了相關防護措施，包括阻斷網路連線和系統隔離，並委請外部第三方資安機構進行數位鑑識。公司初步評估指出，此次事件對整體系統與營運並無重大影響，目前系統仍正常運作。為防止員工個資被用於犯罪行為，緯致科技已向所有員工進行反詐騙宣導，提醒員工提高警覺性，保護個人資訊安全。",
    tags: ["緯致科技", "個資曝險", "系統異常存取", "資安事件", "數位鑑識"],
    title_en: "Witchi Technology Detects Abnormal Internal System Access; Employee Personal Data Potentially Exposed; Company Initiates Security Isolation and Forensics",
    summary_en: "Information technology service company Witchi Technology detected abnormal internal system access on October 8th. Investigations confirmed that personal information and official contact details of some employees may have been exposed. Upon discovering the anomaly, Witchi Technology immediately implemented protective measures, including network disconnection and system isolation, and commissioned an external third-party cybersecurity firm to conduct digital forensics. The company's preliminary assessment indicates that the incident has no major impact on overall system or operations, and systems are currently operating normally. To prevent the use of employee personal data for criminal activities, Witchi Technology has conducted anti-scam awareness campaigns for all employees, reminding them to heighten their vigilance and protect their personal information security.",
