    trackers: ["security"],
    category: "重大事件",
    title: "日本三家旅遊業者曝資料外洩：從密碼到護照資訊，個資風險警訊",
    summary: "日本三家旅遊服務業者——Adventure、H.I.S和TEMAIRAZU，相繼公告發生多起重大資料外洩事件。受影響的個資類型極為廣泛，包括姓名、電子郵件、電話、地址、出生日期等基本資料，甚至包含已雜湊處理的密碼、護照掃描影像檔，以及醫療健康資訊。Adventure的資料外洩事件涉及多個時間點，包括透過管理功能不當操作存取客戶資料，以及因巴士預約頁面設計瑕疵被程式大量瀏覽，導致數千萬筆使用者資訊外洩。H.I.S的事件則揭露了客戶的護照資訊，甚至包含過敏等醫療資料。TEMAIRAZU的預約平臺也曾遭駭客存取，外洩了預約者姓名、住宿期間及費用等資訊。這些事件凸顯了旅遊服務業在系統安全、資料存取控制及網頁設計上的重大漏洞，提醒業界必須強化個資保護與系統監控機制。",
    tags: ["資料外洩", "日本", "旅遊服務業", "個資保護", "Adventure", "H.I.S", "TEMAIRAZU"],
    title_en: "Three Japanese Travel Agencies Exposed to Data Leakage: Personal Data Risks Range from Passwords to Passport Information",
    summary_en: "Three Japanese travel service providers—Adventure, H.I.S, and TEMAIRAZU—have consecutively announced multiple major data leakage incidents. The types of personal data affected are extremely broad, including basic information such as names, email addresses, phone numbers, addresses, and dates of birth, and even hashed passwords, passport scan images, and medical health information. Adventure's data leak involved multiple time points, including unauthorized access to customer data through improper management function operation, and the leakage of tens of millions of user records due to excessive programmatic browsing caused by a design flaw on the bus reservation page. H.I.S's incident revealed customer passport information, including medical data such as allergies. TEMAIRAZU's reservation platform was also accessed by hackers, leaking information such as the reservation holder's name, length of stay, and cost. These incidents highlight significant vulnerabilities in system security, data access control, and web design within the travel service industry, reminding the industry that it must strengthen personal data protection and system monitoring mechanisms.",
    tags_en: ["Data Leakage", "Japan", "Travel Industry", "Personal Data Protection", "Adventure", "H.I.S", "TEMAIRAZU"],
    sources: [
      { name: "iThome", url: "https://ithome.com.tw/news/179565", lang: "ZH-TW" }
    ]
