    title: "금융보안원發表AI技術，提升行動應用程式安全檢測能力，在ISSTA 2026學術會議亮相",
    summary: "금융보안원（Korea Financial Security Institute）開發的AI基礎行動應用程式安全風險偵測技術，已在國際軟體測試與分析學術會議「ISSTA 2026」上發表，並被選入主研究主軸。此技術突破了傳統僅依賴靜態程式碼分析的限制，能夠追蹤並分析應用程式實際執行過程中的行為和資訊流。研究團隊將此技術應用於50個行動應用程式，成功發現了17個安全漏洞。金融보안원計劃以此研究成果，開發「AI基礎檢測框架」，將其應用於實際金融行動應用程式的資安檢測實務，並持續累積新威脅案例以提升偵測技術的精準度。此舉展現了金融보안원具備自主研究並將先進安全技術應用於金融現場的能力。",
    tags: ["금융보안원", "AI", "行動應用程式", "ISSTA 2026", "安全漏洞", "靜態分析", "動態分析"],
    title_en: "Korea Financial Security Institute Presents AI Technology at ISSTA 2026 Academic Conference to Enhance Mobile Application Security Testing Capabilities",
    summary_en: "The AI-based mobile application security risk detection technology developed by the Korea Financial Security Institute (KFSI) was presented at the International Symposium on Software Testing and Analysis (ISSTA 2026) and was selected as a main research track. This technology overcomes the limitations of traditional methods that rely solely on static code analysis, enabling it to track and analyze the behavior and information flow during the actual execution process of an application. The research team applied this technology to 50 mobile applications and successfully discovered 17 security vulnerabilities. KFSI plans to use these research findings to develop an 'AI-based Detection Framework,' applying it to the practical security testing of financial mobile applications, and continuously accumulating new threat cases to improve the precision of the detection technology. This demonstrates KFSI's capability to conduct independent research and apply advanced security technologies to the financial sector.",
    tags_en: ["Korea Financial Security Institute", "AI", "Mobile Applications", "ISSTA 2026", "Security Vulnerability", "Static Analysis", "Dynamic Analysis"],
